@startuml
' Figure 18.7  The runaway run stopped
' Reading order: top to bottom. The April 18 run replayed under the
' enforcer: eight calls settle for $0.97, the ninth would cross the
' $1.00 task budget and is refused, the task hands off, and the ten
' later feed wakes find the budget spent. From cost.demo --part budget.
!include plantuml-theme.puml
participant "Feed" as F <<org>>
participant "Loop" as L <<org>>
participant "Enforcer" as E <<policy>>
participant "Desk" as D <<verified>>
F -> L : Wake 1
L -> E : Calls 1 to 8 settle, $0.97
L -> E : Call 9
E -[$FAIL]> L : Refused
L -> D : Hand-off
F -> L : Wakes 2 to 11
E -[$FAIL]> L : Refused, no call
note over F, D : As run: 264 calls, $45.95
@enduml
